---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Projects" description="Research software, machine-learning experiments, and smaller things built for curiosity.">
  <div class="page-shell data-page">
    <header class="page-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">Work and experiments</p>
      <h1 class="page-title">Projects</h1>
      <p class="page-description">Research software, machine-learning experiments, and smaller things built for curiosity.</p>
    </header>
    <section class="cv-section">
      <h2>Work</h2>
      <ol class="editorial-list">
        <li>
          <time class="date" datetime="2026">2026</time>
          <div>
            <h3><a href="https://github.com/HaowuDuan/FFT_filon" target="_blank" rel="noopener">FFT Filon</a></h3>
            <p>Numerical code for Fourier transforms of Color Glass Condensate multi-Wilson-line correlators using Filon quadrature, with CPU and CUDA implementations.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <time class="date" datetime="2026">2026</time>
          <div>
            <h3><a href="https://github.com/HaowuDuan/jimwlk_fast" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Fast JIMWLK</a></h3>
            <p>GPU-accelerated JIMWLK evolution of SU(3) Wilson lines on a two-dimensional transverse lattice, built with CuPy and custom CUDA kernels.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <time class="date" datetime="2026">2026</time>
          <div>
            <h3><a href="https://github.com/HaowuDuan/nlo_bk_optimized" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NLO BK Optimized</a></h3>
            <p>GPU-optimized code for the NLO BK equation and NLO DIS cross sections.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <time class="date" datetime="2026">2026</time>
          <div>
            <h3><a href="https://github.com/HaowuDuan/hmc_ot_torch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">HMC with OT Resampling</a></h3>
            <p>A PyTorch rebuild of the HMC pipeline with optimal-transport particle-filter resampling and Triton-optimized kernels.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <time class="date" datetime="2026">2026</time>
          <div>
            <h3><a href="https://github.com/HaowuDuan/SU-3-matrix-exp-kernel" target="_blank" rel="noopener">SU(3) Matrix Exponential Kernel</a></h3>
            <p>A custom CUDA kernel for SU(3) matrix exponentiation, delivering a 72× speedup.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>
    <section class="cv-section">
      <h2>Fun</h2>
      <p class="empty-state">Coming soon.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
